            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="CORRECTION">After publication of the article [1], it has been brought to our attention that the first and last names of the third author were transposed in the original article. The author was published as &quot;Ponnet Koen&quot; where in fact the correct name is &quot;Koen Ponnet&quot;. The original article has been revised to reflect this.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
